  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your focus on counterattacks improves their accuracy and enables you to deliver them regardless of your attackers success.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Crane Riposte<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a bonus equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) on attacks of opportunity made using Crane Riposte. In addition, if you use Crane Wing to add a dodge bonus to your Armor Class while fighting defensively and the attack hits anyway, you may take an attack against your attacker, either as an immediate action or an attack of opportunity (your choice).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc54\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
